OL,3,ALetby hospital consultant says inquiry
OL,4,Amakes for grim reading
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the senior doctors who tried to
OL,7,Fraise concerns about Lucy Letby with
OL,8,Fhospital managers has told the BBC the
OL,9,Ffinal inquiry report makes for "grim
OL,10,Freading".
OL,12,FConsultant paediatrician Dr John Gibbs
OL,13,Fworked at the Countess of Chester
OL,14,FHospital throughout the period in 2015
OL,15,Fto 2016 when Letby murdered seven
OL,16,Fbabies, and attempted to murder seven
OL,17,Fmore, on the neonatal unit.
OL,19,FHe said that he accepted that
OL,20,Fconsultants must bear "collective"
OL,21,Fresponsibility for some of the failings
OL,22,Fidentified in the report.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
