OL,3,ALetby hospital consultant says inquiry
OL,4,Amakes for grim reading
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I wish we consultants had been brave
OL,7,Fenough to follow our suspicions and
OL,8,Fescalate things to the police earlier,"
OL,9,Fhe told the BBC.
